---
/**
 * K Culture Wire — **견줄 상대가 화면에 없다.** (`/esports-nations`)
 *
 * ── 왜 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *   78편 다음 물음은 하나였다 — 「이스포츠라서인가, 한국이라서인가」.
 *   ⭐ 재 보니 **비교가 성립하지 않았다.** 다른 나라 선수는 문서가 비슷하게 있는데
 *      동남아에서 읽히지를 않는다. ⛔ 그것을 실패로 접지 않고 **결과로 낸다.**
 *
 * ── ⛔ 이 지면이 지키는 것 ────────────────────────────────────
 * ⛔ 나라를 줄세우지 않는다. 세 수(있나·문서가 있나·읽히나)를 나란히 놓는다.
 * ⛔ 셋이 안 되는 무리로 만장일치를 말하지 않는다. 그 칸은 「말하지 않는다」로 둔다.
 * ⚠ 78편과 몫이 다른 까닭을 **같은 크기로** 적는다. 감추면 두 지면이 서로를 반박한다.
 * ⛔ 광고 자리를 만들지 않는다. Riot Production(App 866800) 승인 전이다.
 *
 * 🔴 Astro 앞말(`---` 사이)은 **TypeScript 다.** JSX 를 넣으면 빌드가 죽는다.
 */
import WikiTip from '../../layouts/WikiTip.astro';
import KcwRelatedArticles from '../../components/KcwRelatedArticles.astro';
import d from '../../data/wikitip-esports-nations.json';

const TITLE = 'We tried to compare Korean esports players with other countries, and could not';
const DESC =
  `Players from China, Sweden and the United States have articles in the Southeast Asian Wikipedias `
  + `at about the same rate Korean players do. ${d.othersReadSharePc}% of theirs are read enough to `
  + `measure, against ${d.koreaReadSharePc}% of the Korean ones. There was no second group to compare against.`;

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Dataset',
  name: TITLE,
  description: DESC,
  creator: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'K Culture Wire' },
  isBasedOn: ['https://www.wikidata.org', 'https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/'],
};
---

<WikiTip title={TITLE} description={DESC} jsonLd={jsonLd}
  canonical="https://www.kculturewire.com/esports-nations">
  <h1>{TITLE}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{d.question}</p>
  <p class="q">
    <b>{d.koreaReadSharePc}%</b> of the Korean players with an article in these editions are read
    enough to measure. For {d.othersCompared.join(', ')} together, the figure is{' '}
    <b>{d.othersReadSharePc}%</b>.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Three different questions, one row each</h2>
    <div class="scroll-x">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Country</th><th>Esports players on Wikidata</th>
          <th>With an article in these four editions</th><th>Read enough to measure</th>
          <th>Share</th><th>Sharing a peak month</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {d.nations.map((n) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="nm">{n.country}</td>
              <td>{n.onWikidata.toLocaleString('en-US')}</td>
              <td>{n.withSeaArticle}</td>
              <td class="tot">{n.readEnoughToMeasure}</td>
              <td>{n.readSharePc === null ? '—' : `${n.readSharePc}%`}</td>
              <td class="fine">
                {n.tooFewToSay
                  ? `fewer than ${d.minPeopleForAGroup} — we do not say`
                  : `${n.sharingPeak} of ${n.peopleInGroup}`}
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="note">
      &ldquo;Read enough to measure&rdquo; means at least {d.minReadsPerYear} reads across the four
      editions in 2025. Below that a single quiet month decides where the peak lands, so we do not
      report one.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="warn-box">
    <h2>The comparison did not work, and that is the result</h2>
    <p class="warn">{d.whyTheComparisonFails}</p>
    <p class="note">
      Groups large enough to speak about: <b>{d.comparison.groups}</b>
      {d.comparison.groups > 0 && ` (${d.comparison.nations.join(', ')})`}.
      {d.comparison.comparable
        ? ' Two groups is the minimum for a comparison, and the second one is Vietnam — home-country readers, which is a different thing again.'
        : ' One group is not a comparison.'}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="warn-box">
    <h2>Why this page and the previous one give different shares</h2>
    <p class="warn">{d.whyThisDiffersFromTheEarlierPage}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="src">
    <h2>How this was counted, and what it cannot say</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Source</b> — {d.source}</li>
      <li><b>Unit</b> — {d.unit}</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="warn">{d.cannotAnswer}</p>
    <p class="note">
      <a href="/one-month">A year of readers in one month</a> ·{' '}
      <a href="/sea-athletes">Four editions, four different athletes</a> ·{' '}
      <a href="/about">How we count</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <KcwRelatedArticles page="/esports-nations" />
</WikiTip>

<style>
  .warn-box { border-left: 3px solid #b45309; padding-left: 1rem; }
</style>
